# E030: Duplicate computed keys that resolve to the same value
# Both $k1 and $k2 are computed keys ($ prefix) that resolve to "x" at runtime.
# The parser cannot catch this because the keys are computed, not literal.
# The evaluator must detect the duplicate when building the dict.
[k1: "x"  k2: "x"]
[result: [$k1: 1  $k2: 2]]
=== error
[E030] duplicate key: x
